Error [E1264]: `handler` reads a secret but doesn't declare the `Secret` effect
  --> tests/ui/secret_ungranted.jet:3:4
    |
  3 | fn handler() {
    |    ^^^^^^^
 Why: reading a secret (`core.vault.get`) always requires an explicit grant — unlike other effects, there is no silently-inferred default here, so a function must opt in even with no other explicit effect row at all.
 Fix: add `--[Secret]->` to `handler`'s signature (or widen an existing effect row to cover it)

